# Licensed market data must never be committed. EODHD and similar vendors
# license data for your own use, not for redistribution -- and a GitHub repo is
# redistribution.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing: a bare `data/` matches ANY directory named
# data at any depth, which silently excluded src/tradelab/data/ and left the
# EODHD provider untracked. Anchor it to the repository root.
/data/
*.parquet
*.csv
*.duckdb
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
state/
logs/
*.log
runs/
research/output/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
secrets.yaml
.eodhd_token
*.token
